layout uv

# Component configuration does NOT belong in this file.
#
# `.envrc` is a direnv hook: it applies only when a shell's working
# directory is inside this repo, and only when direnv is installed and
# this file has been allowed. An export here is therefore
#
#   - absent for any service launched from another directory (e.g. a
#     launchd plist), so the dev shell and the running service disagree
#     with no error; and
#   - higher precedence than the XDG overlay for every process started
#     from this directory, because Oneiric's source chain puts env vars
#     above all YAML layers (`oneiric/core/config.py`).
#
# Per-machine settings belong in `~/.config/akosha/local.yaml` (XDG
# layer); secrets belong in `~/.config/secrets.env`.
#
# This file previously exported `AKOSHA__STORAGE__HOT__PG_URL`, a
# credentialed Postgres DSN. It was doubly dead: the pgvector *hot*
# tier was removed 2026-09-27, and `pg_url` is a `WarmStorageConfig`
# field, not a `HotStorageConfig` field — so the var bound to nothing.
# The live warm-tier connection lives in the XDG overlay.
# Removed 2026-11-05.